 "pin_source": "FLAT COLUMN (Q-DVM 2026-10-15 structural directive): head + 8 leaves hardened ONCE as one master with no internal hard faces; die-facing ports only (head-row words W/E spread over 250 um = 0.16 um/pin, corridor words 74 um, ck0..ck8 at the published entry XY). Proposed to the compute die lead; die tool re-assigns.",
 "slot_change_request": "el1014-qwen-dvm-build.log / el1014-qwen-split-compute.log 2026-10-15 Q-DVM: qfd_xcol_e/w stays ONE instance per column in the approved 64.8 x 1434.24 slot with scalar ck0..ck8 (C12 contract), but is a single flat hard master instead of a head + 8-leaf stack: removes the eight 1170-bit leaf faces (1170 pins on 64.8 um = 0.77 of the M3+M5 2-track pin slots, above the 0.55-0.60 cut rule; xl6/xl8/xh5 GRT congestion, xe2 setup -419 ps on N-face output paths). Head-row W/E pins respread over 250 um (die pin file to follow).",
